.claude/worktrees/
# QA screenshots an agent took while checking a screen. 42 of them, 29MB, and
# several are of screens that no longer exist (Skin Lab). They are working notes
# from one session, not a baseline anything compares against — the visual
# baselines Playwright uses live in apps/webapp/tests/visual.spec.ts-snapshots.
.claude/qa-snaps/
apps/extractor/bin/
# The TWA wrapper. Only apps/android/twa-manifest.json is source — everything
# else in there is regenerated from it by `bubblewrap build`, and several hundred
# files of generated Gradle project would bury the one file anybody edits.
apps/android/*
!apps/android/twa-manifest.json
!apps/android/README.md
# A signing credential. Never commit this, under any name.
*.keystore
*.jks
